stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Candidate: business and architecture need
    Candidate --> Scoped: scenario and profile approved
    Scoped --> Implementing: trace and fixtures ready
    Implementing --> Reference: conformance evidence accepted
    Reference --> Maintained: released and supported
    Maintained --> Adapting: production use selected
    Adapting --> Productionizing: workload and risk assessment
    Productionizing --> Pilot: controls and operations ready
    Pilot --> Production: acceptance and service approval
    Pilot --> Adapting: remediation required
    Production --> Feedback: operating evidence
    Feedback --> Maintained: reference improvement
    Feedback --> Scoped: architecture change proposed
    Maintained --> Retired: obsolete or replaced
    Retired --> [*]

    note right of Reference
        Demonstrates one conformant realization
        Does not imply production readiness
    end note

    note right of Productionizing
        Business, data, security, capacity,
        resilience, support, cost, and compliance
    end note
